@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1

### L1. Hapus jenis surat yang masih dipakai -> 409
DELETE {{base}}/jenis-surat/1
Accept: application/json

### L2. Statistik -> 200
GET {{base}}/statistik
Accept: application/json

### L3. Detail surat 1 + dosen penyetuju -> 200
GET {{base}}/surat/1
Accept: application/json

### L4a. Hapus surat (soft delete) -> 204
DELETE {{base}}/surat/5
Accept: application/json

### L4b. Surat terhapus tidak bisa dibuka -> 404
GET {{base}}/surat/5
Accept: application/json

### L4c. Daftar surat terhapus -> 200
GET {{base}}/surat-terhapus
Accept: application/json

### L4d. Pulihkan surat -> 200
POST {{base}}/surat/5/pulihkan
Accept: application/json